[[Mirage Iboga]]s are found in the company of other plant creatures. They can [[snare (tactic)|snare]], prevent [[adrenaline]] gain, and cause [[health degeneration]]. Most of their skills are [[hexes]] which they extend with their [[stance]], so [[List of hex removal skills|hex removal]] is useful.

